    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "number": 2,
      "heading": "Crisp the bacon",
      "blocks": [
        "Boil a full kettle. Heat olive oil in a wide pan on high, then fry the bacon lardons for about 4 minutes until starting to crisp."
