      "id": "step-3",
      "number": 3,
      "heading": "Cook the tagliatelle",
      "blocks": [
        "Cook the tagliatelle in boiling salted water for 3–4 minutes until it has a slight bite. Drain and reserve enough starchy water for the stock plus a splash for loosening."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Cook the tagliatelle",
          "seconds": [
            180,
            240
