        "credit": "Illustration based on the Gousto recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "number": 5,
      "heading": "Make the Alfredo sauce",
      "blocks": [
        "Dissolve the chicken stock mix in {{pasta-water}} reserved pasta water and stir in the soft cheese. Mix {{flour}} flour into the bacon pan and cook 30 seconds. Add the creamy stock and half the hard cheese and cook 1–2 minutes until it starts to thicken."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
