    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "number": 6,
      "heading": "Wilt the spinach",
      "blocks": [
        "Wash the spinach in a colander. Pour over boiling water, cool under the cold tap, squeeze dry and roughly chop."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
